# Local environment files must never reach a build. client/.env carries
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000 for local development, and Vite loads
# .env in every mode - so if it is uploaded, the deployed bundle tells every
# visitor's browser to call their own machine for the API. The build command
# also sets the variable explicitly; this is the second lock on the same door.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules
server/uploads
DEPLOY-VERCEL.local.md
